<title>UK: DSL unit sets 1.5 bln FRF December 2002 Eurobond.</title>
<headline>DSL unit sets 1.5 bln FRF December 2002 Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Caisse Nationale De Credit Agricole.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    05.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.465   PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.84     SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT DUE NOVEMBER 2002</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/UK/DE/FR/NL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
